---
description: Transport and validation rules for FastAPI endpoints.
globs: backend/app/api/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

# FastAPI boundary

- Routes decode, validate, call, and encode. They do not train models or implement metrics.
- Validate image magic bytes, payload size, dimensions, category id, and model id before inference.
- Return clear 4xx responses for invalid client input. Return 501 when the catalog model is not ready.
- Keep uploads ephemeral. Do not log payloads or base64 maps.
- Category and model ids come from the YAML catalogs.
- Never start a training loop, subprocess shell, or checkpoint write from a route.
